{"PageNumber":398,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":29,"SurahIndex":"029","VerseNumber":15,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَأَنجَيۡنَٰهُ وَأَصۡحَٰبَ ٱلسَّفِينَةِ وَجَعَلۡنَٰهَآ ءَايَةٗ لِّلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","TajweedText":"فَأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نج</tajweed>َيْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ وَأَصْحَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّفِينَةِ وَجَعَلْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> ءَايَ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ةً ل</tajweed>ِّلْعَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٥</span>","End":"١٥","PageNumber":398,"JuzNumber":20,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":343,"MaqraNumber":159,"HizbNumber":40,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":29,"SurahIndex":"029","VerseNumber":16,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِبۡرَٰهِيمَ إِذۡ قَالَ لِقَوۡمِهِ ٱعۡبُدُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَٱتَّقُوهُۖ ذَٰلِكُمۡ خَيۡرٞ لَّكُمۡ إِن كُنتُمۡ تَعۡلَمُونَ","TajweedText":"وَإِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>ر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>هِيمَ إِذْ قَالَ لِقَوْمِهِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>عْبُدُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّقُوهُ‌ۖ ذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكُمْ خَيْ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>رٌ ل</tajweed>َّكُمْ إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ تَعْلَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٦</span>","End":"١٦","PageNumber":398,"JuzNumber":20,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":343,"MaqraNumber":159,"HizbNumber":40,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":29,"SurahIndex":"029","VerseNumber":17,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّمَا تَعۡبُدُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ أَوۡثَٰنٗا وَتَخۡلُقُونَ إِفۡكًاۚ إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ تَعۡبُد