ber":40,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":29,"SurahIndex":"029","VerseNumber":23,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ بِـَٔايَٰتِ ٱللَّهِ وَلِقَآئِهِۦٓ أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ يَئِسُواْ مِن رَّحۡمَتِي وَأُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُمۡ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٞ","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِـَٔـايَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ وَلِق<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓئِه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِۦٓ</tajweed> أُ<tajweed class=slnt>وْ</tajweed>لَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>ئِكَ يَئِسُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> م<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ر</tajweed>َّحْمَتِى وَأُ<tajweed class=slnt>وْ</tajweed>لَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>ئِكَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>٢٣</span>","End":"٢٣","PageNumber":398,"JuzNumber":20,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":344,"MaqraNumber":159,"HizbNumber":40,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false}]}